15:29.680 --> 15:30.880
Hanya dua perkara.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.800
Kemegahan.

15:32.800 --> 15:33.760
Wanita.

15:35.800 --> 15:36.960
Maharani.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.440
Awak nak selamatkan orang?

15:38.880 --> 15:41.200
Saya mahukan orang.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.880
Awak nak berlagak?

15:44.360 --> 15:46.520
